OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity to revert to original
OL,4,Aname in merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FCranfield University will revert to
OL,7,Fbeing known by its former name as part
OL,8,Fof a merger with King's College London.
OL,10,FThe Bedfordshire institution will once
OL,11,Fagain be the Cranfield Institute of
OL,12,FTechnology when the merger is completed
OL,13,Fnext August. It has been known by its
OL,14,Fcurrent name since 1993.
OL,16,FIt will become the 10th faculty of
OL,17,FKing's and will include Cranfield
OL,18,FDefence and Security, which will work
OL,19,Fwith the King's School of Security
OL,20,FStudies.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
