OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity to revert to original
OL,4,Aname in merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Shitij Kapur, vice-chancellor and
OL,7,Fpresident of King's, said the merger
OL,8,Fwas intended to "enhance the impact
OL,9,Fthat King's and Cranfield already have
OL,10,Fon our society".
